<title>USA: Va. College Authority $39.6 mln won by Craigie.</title>
<headline>Va. College Authority $39.6 mln won by Craigie.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craigie Inc. said Tuesday it won $39.6 million Virginia College Building Authority revenue bonds at a true interest cost of 4.641 percent.</p>
</text>
